{"2967400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Playstories", "steam_appid": 2967400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playstories is an interactive role-playing story game about choices, memories, and community-created worlds. Enter curated stories from the hall, or create your own premise, protagonist, and world, then watch the story react to what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can change attributes, relationships, pressure, resources, and memories. Save key moments, review your history, publish stories to the community, or continue worlds created by other players until a story becomes unmistakably yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no fixed script asking you to guess the correct answer. Who you become, who you trust, what you give up, and what you remember can all push the story in a new direction. The next scene is written by your choices.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playstories is an interactive role-playing story game about choices, memories, and community-created worlds. Enter curated stories from the hall, or create your own premise, protagonist, and world, then watch the story react to what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can change attributes, relationships, pressure, resources, and memories. Save key moments, review your history, publish stories to the community, or continue worlds created by other players until a story becomes unmistakably yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no fixed script asking you to guess the correct answer. Who you become, who you trust, what you give up, and what you remember can all push the story in a new direction. The next scene is written by your choices.</p>", "short_description": "Play a role. Write your story. Step into a live AI story hall where every choice can reshape relationships, memories, and fate.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Ja